v/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 103, lines 49-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 15, lines 19-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 15, lines 19-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 36, lines 55-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 36, lines 55-11"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 60, lines 37-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 60, lines 37-31"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 66, lines 53-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 66, lines 53-39"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on April 19, 2021."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 11-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 11-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 79, lines 39-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 79, lines 39-11"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["The government wants the Court to confirm that Alaska Native Corporations are not Indian Tribes.","The tribes want the Court to declare that Alaska Native Corporations are Indian Tribes."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 103, lines 49-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 103, lines 49-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 15, lines 19-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 15, lines 19-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 36, lines 55-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 36, lines 55-11"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 60, lines 37-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 60, lines 37-31"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 66, lines 53-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/20-543_hgci.pdf","page_label":"file page 66, lines 53-39"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["The government argues that Alaska Native Corporations lack the formal political recognition required by the statute.","The tribes argue that Congress intended to include Alaska Native Corporations in the definition of Indian Tribe."],"sources":[{"evidenc